\n*Watch hundreds of streams of festivals and music like Primavera Sound, Lollapalooza, EDC, Bonnaroo, Roskilde, ACL. All the festivals you want to see, all at your fingertips. \n*Keep up to date with the latest sports competitions, F1 and WRC racing and many other events through live streams and catch-ups. \n\nVisit us on: \nhttps://www.redbull.tv\nhttps://www.facebook.com/RedBullTV/?fref=ts\nhttps://twitter.com/RedBullTV\nhttps://www.instagram.com/redbulltv/?hl=en\n\n*This app requires Oculus TV. Please search and download Oculus TV in order to watch Red Bull TV.", "short_description": "After June 15th, 2023, the Redbull TV app will no longer be available on Go.\n\nGo beyond the ordinary with exclusive videos & live events from around the world"}]}, "developer_name": "Red Bull", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.redbull.tv/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.redbull.tv/terms", "publisher_name": "Red Bull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.redbull.tv/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "MOVIE", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_EX"], "id": "489804355873995"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12522302_1987268728204918_1675924495489040384_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=elIwgzbMYRcQ7kNvwElJpx0&_nc_oc=AdqgUv7wSXPZa4KvdKurnz8QE9N3H0Ziy7j7Q4LFuPFhfdOB2EOl86VJUtrPErHV